Modifications in this repository

The embedded selection in 93904804516.spg.xz is unchanged from
arrange/data/n12t-selection.txt.xz in jhalfar/superpermutations, commit
c9cb923057f757efa7c0f0e4c4cc1677ef3e6d3b. Its original comments are preserved.

William Echols, working with GPT-6.1 Sol xhigh, optimized the group openings
and joins of the earlier 93,904,936,032-symbol construction to obtain
93,904,804,516 symbols on October 18, 2026. The JSON group plan, Python
decoder and structural verifier were prepared for this repository.
The construction uses Jay Pantone's slices, transport, completion and
closed trails; the seed data is Jakub Halfar's. Distributed under Apache 2.0.
